## Interface: 50500, 50502, 50503, 50504, 50505
## Title: ArenaPlus
## Author: David / Atlas-Engine
## Version: 1.0
## Notes: Rated arena and battleground tracking - match history with specs and crowd control, live title cutoffs and the ladder.
## SavedVariables: ArenaPlus_SavedVars
# Loads ArenaPlus_Data first when it is installed. Optional rather than a hard
# dependency: without it the addon still runs, with an empty ladder and no
# cutoffs, which is a better failure than refusing to load at all.
## OptionalDeps: ArenaPlus_Data

# Core
#
# The ladder, the cutoffs, the specs and the gear now live in ArenaPlus_Data,
# which is republished on its own -- they were half of every release here. What
# is left in Data\ is the two tables harvested once from the client, which only
# change if Blizzard changes a talent or a glyph.
Locales.lua
Data\TalentGrid.lua
Data\GlyphData.lua
HardCC.lua
SpecData.lua
SpecSpells.lua
SpecFixups.lua
HistorySeed.lua
Core.lua

